ass=" xl:relative w-[50px] xl:w-[500px] h-[50px] px-4 py-4 bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-dark_secondary rounded-full flex justify-start items-center"><input type="text" class="hidden cs-text xl:block flex-1 justify-center font-normal dark:text-white dark:bg-dark_secondary dark:placeholder:text-dark_placeholder placeholder:text-gray-900 border-none focus:outline-none focus:ring-0 bg-zinc-100 p-0 backdrop-blur-xl" placeholder="Looking for information on Clearstream services or news?"/><button class="justify-center items-center cursor-pointer min-w-[18px]" aria-label="Submit search"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="dark:invert" style="color:transparent" src="/asset/searchLogo.svg"/></button></div><button class="flex justify-center h-[50px] w-[50px] items-center shrink-0 bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-dark_secondary rounded-full" aria-label="Open user profile" type="button" id="user-profile-button"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="16" height="18" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-full dark:invert" style="color:transparent" src="/asset/loginIcon.svg"/></button></div></div></header></div></div></div><main class="flex-grow"><div class="w-full sm:flex hidden pb-4 px-1  rounded-full  backdrop-blur-sm flex-nowrap whitespace-nowrap overflow-x-auto items-center gap-2" style="scrollbar-width:none"><div class="py-2.5 flex justify-start items-center text-nowrap"><div class="cs-text justify-center text-center text-neutral-900 dark:text-white"><a class="text-center" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="/clearstream-en">Clearstream Home</a></div></div><div class="flex-shrink-0 text-right justify-center"><img alt="Arrow icon" loading="lazy" width="20" height="12" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="dark:invert" style="color:transparent" src="/asset/rightArrow.svg"/></div><div class="py-2.5 flex justify-start items-center text-nowrap"><div class="cs-text justify-center text-center text-neutral-900 dark:text-white"><a class="text-center" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="/clearstream-en/global-fund-summit-luxembourg-2026-join-the-premier-funds-event-in-luxembourg-5162026">Fund Summit 2026</a></div></div></div><div class="relative grid gap-12 w-full h-full grid-cols-1"><div class="w-full flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-5 lg:gap-2 items-start lg:items-stretch"><div class=" flex flex-col lg:w-2/3 w-full"><div class="bg-white dark:bg-dark_primary h-[91px] lg:h-[81px] xl:h-[81px] w-1/2" style="border-radius:20px 20px 0 0"></div><section class="relative bg-white dark:bg-dark_primary h-full flex flex-col px-6 w-[992px] sm:min-h-[313px] md:min-h-[349px] lg:min-h-[538px]] w-full" style="border-radius:0 20px 20px 20px"><div class="cs-text mt-[30px]"><span class="w-fit text-neutral-900 dark:text-white font-bold sm:px-0 px-2 pt-2 rounded-full">Event</span><h1 class="cs-h2 text-black dark:text-white sm:mt-4 mt-1 sm:pt-4 pt-2">Global Fund Summit Luxembourg 2026: Join the Premier Funds Event in Luxembourg</h1></div><div class="cs-h3 mt-2 w-fit text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">Be part of the conversation that shapes the future of the global fund industry. </div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-7 mb-10"><div class="cs-text text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">Dealing | Distribution | Fund Services</div></div></section></div><div class="relative w-full lg:w-1/3 flex flex-col justify-between gap-5 lg:gap-2 h-full"><div class="hidden lg:flex justify-end mb-[6px]"><div style="height:60px;width:124px"></div></div><div class="w-full bg-white dark:bg-dark_primary rounded-2xl p-6 h-full tracking-[-0.04em] w-[484px] min-h-[184px]"><p class="cs-text font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white mb-5 uppercase">Reference</p><div class="space-y-2"><div class="flex gap-[30px]"><div class="cs-text w-[94px] text-neutral-900/30 dark:text-white/30">Service level</div><div class="cs-text flex-1 text-neutral-900 dark:text-white font-medium">CFCL</div></div><div class="flex gap-[30px]"><div class="cs-text w-[94px] text-neutral-900/30 dark:text-white/30">Run Time</div><div class="cs-text flex-1 text-neutral-900 dark:text-white font-medium">29.10.2026</div></div><div class="flex gap-[30px]"><div class="cs-text w-[94px] text-neutral-900/30 dark:text-white/30">Location</div><div class="cs-text flex-1 text-neutral-900 dark:text-white font-medium"> Kinepolis Kirchberg - Luxembourg</div></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-row space-x-8 w-full"><a class="w-96 cs-text min-h-14 pl-5 py-2 pr-2 justify-between items-center rounded-full flexbtn flex group  bg-gradient-secondary text-white  text-base font-normal leading-5 w-full " target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="https://globalfundsummit2026.deutsche-boerse-events.com/#EB2A2A"><span class="" style="word-break:break-word">Register here!</span><span class="relative flex justify-center items-center shrink-0 rounded-full w-10 h-10 bg-black group-hover:bg-white " aria-hidden="true"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="18" height="19" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-0 " style="color:transparent" src="/asset/attachment-white.svg"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="18" height="19" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 " style="color:transparent" src="/asset/attachment-black.svg"/></span></a></div></div></div><div class="relative richtext richtext-two-column cs-text-medium articleRichText text-neutral-900 dark:text-white"><p class="rt">Clearstream is pleased to invite you to the next edition of our Global Fund Summit, the premier annual event for asset managers and distributors seeking meaningful dialogue, strategic insights, and high-impact networking opportunities. </p><p class="rt">Designed exclusively for fund industry professionals, our Luxembourg edition features a highly interactive format that fosters open discussion and knowledge sharing among a carefully curated audience of decision-makers and innovators. </p><h2 class="rt cs-h2"><strong class="rt">Event Highlights</strong></h2><h3 class="rt cs-h4 text-neutral-900/50 dark:text-white/50">Welcome Dinner: </h3><p class="rt">The experience begins with an exclusive Welcome Dinner on the evening of October 28, setting the stage for productive networking and relationship building.</p><h3 class="rt cs-h4 text-neutral-900/50 dark:text-white/50">Expert-Led Discussions:</h3><p class="rt">October 29 features a focused afternoon of expert-led panel discussions on the latest developments shaping the fund services industry.</p><h3 class="rt cs-h4 text-neutral-900/50 dark:text-white/50">Networking Cocktail:</h3><p class="rt">The Summit concludes with a celebratory networking cocktail, providing the perfect opportunity to deepen connections and explore future collaborations.</p><p class="rt"><br class="rt"/></p><h2 class="rt cs-h2"><strong class="rt">Why Attend the Global Fund Summit Luxembourg 2026? </strong></h2><p class="rt"><strong class="rt">Insightful Discussions:</strong> Dive into the latest developments in fund services, asset management, and distribution technologies. Explore pressing topics ranging from execution and distribution to data management and artificial intelligence.</p><p class="rt"><strong class="rt">Networking Opportunities</strong>: Connect with leading asset managers, distributors, and industry leaders in an environment specifically designed to maximize meaningful engagement with fellow professionals.</p><p class="rt"><strong class="rt">Innovative Solutions:</strong> Discover cutting-edge solutions and strategies shaping the future of the global fund industry, from digital assets and blockchain technology to AI-driven platforms and next-generation fund distribution models.</p><p class="rt"><strong class="rt">Strategic Insights: </strong>Gain valuable perspectives on global trends, regulatory developments, and market opportunities from over 12 distinguished speakers who are recognized leaders in their fields.</p><p class="rt"><br class="rt"/></p><h2 class="rt cs-h2"><strong class="rt">Event Details </strong></h2><p class="rt"><strong class="rt">Dates:</strong> October 28-29, 2026 </p><p class="rt"><strong class="rt">Location:</strong> Kinepolis Kirchberg, 45 Avenue John F. Kennedy, 1855 Luxembourg </p><p class="rt"><strong class="rt">Program</strong>: Over 8 sessions covering a wide range of industry topics </p><p class="rt"><strong class="rt">Audience</strong>: Senior asset management professionals, fund distributors, and industry innovators </p><p class="rt"><br class="rt"/></p><p class="rt">As technology, digital assets, and artificial intelligence continue to reshape the global economy, Clearstream remains at the forefront of this transformation. Join us at the Global Fund Summit Luxembourg 2026 to be part of the conversation that defines the future of the fund industry. </p><p class="rt">For more information, contact the <strong class="rt">Clearstream events team </strong>(<a class="rt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-disabled="false" href="mailto:cfsevents@clearstream.com">cfsevents@clearstream.com</a>). </p><p class="rt"><br class="rt"/></p><p class="rt"><em class="rt">Clearstream – Where the Market Meets Innovation </em></p><p class="rt"><br class="rt"/></p><p class="rt"><video controls="" title="" class="w-full object-content rounded-[30px] rt"><source src="/caas/v1/media/4955488/data/8805b62655cb9b5c7a7a124837a63ae5/highlights-from-the-previous-edition-2025-.mp4" type="video/mp4"/>Your browser does not support the video tag.</video></p><p class="align--center rt"><br class="rt"/></p><p class="rt"><br class="rt"/></p></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><div class="relative w-full py-4"><footer class="w-full max-w-[1500px] mt-20"><div class="rounded-[20px] overflow-hidden shadow-md bg-white dark:bg-dark_primary w-full max-w-[1500px] h-[230px] md:h-[202px] lg:h-[218px] xl:h-[194px] py-6 px-8 sm:px-12 flex flex-col xl:flex-row items-start xl:items-center justify-between gap-4"><p class="cs-text-big md:w-[648px] lg:w-[824px] xl:w-[687px] w-full font-light dark:text-white">Clearstream News: To receive our newsletters, complete the subscription form. </p><div class="flex gap-2 sm:gap-4 h-[60px] w-full sm:w-1/2 lg:max-w-[396px] lg:items-center lg:justify-end"><a class="w-96 cs-text min-h-14 pl-5 py-2 pr-2 justify-between items-center rounded-full flexbtn flex group bg-gradient-primary  text-white  text-base font-normal leading-5  " target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-disabled="false" href="https://smc-lp.s4hana.ondemand.com/eu/p/871vi?"><span class="" style="word-break:break-word">Subscribe</span><span class="relative flex justify-center items-center shrink-0 rounded-full w-10 h-10 bg-black group-hover:bg-white " aria-hidden="true"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="18" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-0 " style="color:transparent" src="/asset/arrow-right.svg"/><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="16" height="14" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute transition-opacity opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 " style="color:transparent" src="/asset/arrow-right-dark.svg"/></span></a></div></div><div class="max-w-[1500px] w-full"><div class="max-w-[1500px] h-[1px] opacity-20 border-b border-black dark:border-white pt-20 pb-15"></div><section class="flex flex-col xl:flex-row h-full w-full  pb-6 gap-4"><div class="md:w-1/2 xl:w-1/2 flex flex-col justify-start gap-4 min-h-[150px] mt-6"><img alt="Deutsche Börse Group Logo" loading="lazy" width="380" height="72" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 bg-center bg-cover bg-no-repeat dark:hidden" style="color:transparent" src="/caas/v1/media/4602812/data/86a769ff5b08c1302dbc6feb3939f925"/><img alt="Deutsche Börse Group Logo" loading="lazy" width="380" height="72" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shrink-0 bg-center bg-cover bg-no-repeat hidden dark:block" style="color:transparent" src="/caas/v1/media/4922482/data/84a9352fcb78de630b965787a9381d5c"/><p class="cs-text w-full md:w-[484px] gap-6 overflow-hidden">Clearstream is part of Deutsche Börse Group, an international exchange organization and provider of innovative market infrastructures. Our vision is to create the leading securities and funds servicing ecosystems of tomorrow jointly with our clients and partners. </p><a class="cs-text underline" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="/clearstream-en/about-clearstream">Find out more</a></div><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row xl:w-1/2 h-full w-full border-b-0 pb-6 gap-4 lg:ml-0"><div class="w-full md:w-1/2 lg:w-1/2 mt-6"><p class="cs-text font-bold uppercase mb-2">Applications</p><div class="w-full h-[1px] mt-2 opacity-20 bg-black dark:bg-white"></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4"><ul class="space-y-2"><li><a class="cs-text text-black dark:text-white hover:underline" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="https://codelist.clearstream.com/codelist">Codelist</a></li><li><a class="cs-text text-black dark:text-white hover:underline" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="https://www.cdinternet.com/">Xact File Transfer via Internet</a></li><li><a class="cs-text text-black dark:text-white hover:underline" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="https://xact.clearstream.com/">Xact Web Portal</a></li><li><a class="cs-text text-black dark:text-white hover:underline" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="https://membersection.deutsche-boerse.com/">Billing Portal</a></li><li><a class="cs-text text-black dark:text-white hover:underline" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="https://public-security-terms.clearstream.com/">Public Node (Niederlegung)</a></li></ul><ul class="space-y-2"><li><a class="cs-text text-black dark:text-white hover:underline" target="_self" aria-disabled="false" href="https://emission.clearstream.com/">eMISSION Service</a></li><li><a class="cs-text text-black dark:text-white hover:underline" ta