istributors seeking meaningful dialogue, strategic insights, and high-impact networking opportunities. Designed exclusively for fund industry professionals, our Luxembourg edition features a highly interactive format that fosters open discussion and knowledge sharing among a carefully curated audience of decision-makers and innovators. Event HighlightsWelcome Dinner: The experience begins with an exclusive Welcome Dinner on the evening of October 28, setting the stage for productive networking and relationship building.Expert-Led Discussions:October 29 features a focused afternoon of expert-led panel discussions on the latest developments shaping the fund services industry.Networking Cocktail:The Summit concludes with a celebratory networking cocktail, providing the perfect opportunity to deepen connections and explore future collaborations.Why Attend the Global Fund Summit Luxembourg 2026? Insightful Discussions: Dive into the latest developments in fund services, asset management, and distribution technologies. Explore pressing topics ranging from execution and distribution to data management and artificial intelligence.Networking Opportunities: Connect with leading asset managers, distributors, and industry leaders in an environment specifically designed to maximize meaningful engagement with fellow professionals.Innovative Solutions: Discover cutting-edge solutions and strategies shaping the future of the global fund industry, from digital assets and blockchain technology to AI-driven platforms and next-generation fund distribution models.Strategic Insights: Gain valuable perspectives on global trends, regulatory developments, and market opportunities from over 12 distinguished speakers who are recognized leaders in their fields.Event Details Dates: October 28-29, 2026 Location: Kinepolis Kirchberg, 45 Avenue John F. Kennedy, 1855 Luxembourg Program: Over 8 sessions covering a wide range of industry topics Audience: Senior asset management professionals, fund distributors, and industry innovators As technology, digital assets, and artificial intelligence continue to reshape the global economy, Clearstream remains at the forefront of this transformation. Join us at the Global Fund Summit Luxembourg 2026 to be part of the conversation that defines the future of the fund industry. For more information, contact the Clearstream events team (cfsevents@clearstream.com). Clearstream – Where the Market Meets Innovation "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"9:{\"metadata\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Global Fund Summit Luxembourg 2026: Join the Premier Funds Event in Luxembourg\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"$2d\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"name\":\"robots\",\"content\":\"index, follow\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"3\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://www.clearstream.com/clearstream-en/global-fund-summit-luxembourg-2026-join-the-premier-funds-event-in-luxembourg-5162026\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"4\",{\"rel\":\"alternate\",\"hrefLang\":\"en\",\"href\":\"https://www.clearstream.com/clearstream-en/global-fund-summit-luxembourg-2026-join-the-premier-funds-event-in-luxembourg-5162026\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"5\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.svg\",\"type\":\"image/svg+xml\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2e\",\"6\",{}]],\"error\":null,\"digest\":\"$undefined\"}\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"e:\"$9:metadata\"\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"5:[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full sm:flex hidden pb-4 px-1  rounded-full  backdrop-blur-sm flex-nowrap whitespace-nowrap overflow-x-auto items-center gap-2\",\"style\":{\"scrollbarWidth\":\"none\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"46027740\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"py-2.5 flex justify-start items-center text-nowrap\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"cs-text justify-center text-center text-neutral-900 dark:text-white\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"button\":false,\"href\":\"clearst